    {
      "id": "e01",
      "type": "reading",
      "title": "Can you come on Friday?",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "নাদিয়া, তুমি কি শুক্রবার আমাদের বাসায় আসতে পারবে?",
          "tr": "nadiya, tumi ki shukrobar amader bashay ashte parbe?",
          "en": "Nadia, can you come to our place on Friday?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "দুঃখিত, শুক্রবার আমাকে অফিসে যেতে হবে।",
          "tr": "dukkhito, shukrobar amake ofise jete hobe.",
          "en": "Sorry, on Friday I have to go to the office."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "শনিবার কি তোমাকে অফিসে যেতে হবে?",
          "tr": "shonibar ki tomake ofise jete hobe?",
          "en": "Do you have to go to the office on Saturday?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "না, শনিবার যেতে হবে না। শনিবার আমি আসতে পারব। কয়টায় আসতে হবে?",
          "tr": "na, shonibar jete hobe na. shonibar ami ashte parbo. koytay ashte hobe?",
          "en": "No, I don't have to go on Saturday. I can come on Saturday. What time should I come?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "সন্ধ্যা সাতটায়। আম্মু তোমার জন্য বিরিয়ানি রান্না করতে চান।",
          "tr": "shondha shattay. ammu tomar jonno biriyani ranna korte chan.",
          "en": "At seven in the evening. Mum wants to cook biryani for you."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "খুব ভালো! গত সপ্তাহে আমি আসতে পারিনি, তাই শনিবার অবশ্যই আসব।",
          "tr": "khub bhalo! goto shoptahe ami ashte parini, tai shonibar oboshshoi ashbo.",
          "en": "Great! I couldn't come last week, so I'll definitely come on Saturday."
        }
      ],
      "question": "When will Nadia come?",
      "options": [
        "On Friday evening",
        "On Saturday evening",
        "On Saturday morning"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "why": "Nadia **has to** work on Friday (**যেতে হবে**), but **শনিবার আমি আসতে পারব**; Rafi says **সন্ধ্যা সাতটায়**."
